---
title: Becoming a host and verification
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Website
    participant A as Django API
    participant S as Object storage
    actor M as Moderator
    W->>A: GET /onboarding/flows/{host_type}
    U->>W: Fills the steps (draft saved on the server)
    W->>A: PUT /me/onboarding-drafts/{host_type}
    U->>W: Adds ID and business documents
    W->>A: POST /media/uploads (presign)
    A-->>W: presigned PUT URL (private bucket, quarantine)
    W->>S: upload file
    W->>A: POST /me/onboarding-drafts/{host_type}/submit
    A->>A: validate answers against the flow version
    A->>A: create host account, organisation, owner membership, documents, case
    A-)M: case appears in the queue, waiting time starts
    M->>A: approve each document, then the host
    A-)U: verified (email and SMS)
    U->>W: Creates a first listing and submits it for review
